<p>Fire three shots in quick succession at a vulnerable point on the target (usually the head).</p><p>Each shot deals <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">50%, 58%, 64%, 70%, 75%</acronym> Ranged damage and will try to stun or increase the target's stun duration by 1.</p><p>These shots will bypass other enemies between you and your target.</p><p>The chance to stun increases with your Accuracy.</p>